  "behavior": "New games: Malware Mayhem, Sugar Snap and Gabu's Lockscreen. Wobbly Wafers becomes a digital Jenga (slide wafers out by hand, per-wafer grip, center-of-mass balance, a settling wobble, a smoother fall). Bubble Bloom fills the cabinet in one framed field with combos, a Bloom meter and rainbow bubbles. Tic Tac Treats keeps only each side's three newest treats. Malware Mayhem corners late turns and ignores swipe backlash. Cake Tower's wobble cue is a light tick; Gabu's line uses the original box with layouts kept clear of it; darker cabinets for four 2.7.0 games; Gabu's amber and blue eyes on every object that stands in for him.",
